WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:39.530 --> 01:42.240
Hey, Shin, did you change the soup stock?

01:42.240 --> 01:45.580
Yeah, it's a bonito stock.
It's a gift from Miss Ritsuko.

01:51.670 --> 01:54.210
That was HOT!

01:54.210 --> 01:55.420
I'm sorry.

01:55.420 --> 02:00.260
You always apologize right away,
but do you actually feel sorry?!

02:00.260 --> 02:06.600
It's like you apologize automatically
so that you don't get yelled at!

02:06.600 --> 02:07.310
I'm sorry.

02:07.310 --> 02:10.900
Exactly like that. You're just
fundamentally too self-deprecating!

02:10.900 --> 02:14.780
Now, now, that's just his way.

02:14.780 --> 02:17.900
Just his way?! You're being too soft on him!

02:17.900 --> 02:20.620
Haven't you been a little
too soft on Shinji lately?

02:20.620 --> 02:21.620
Have I?

02:21.620 --> 02:23.790
Maybe you and Mr. Kaji have hooked up again,

02:23.790 --> 02:26.450
but don't project your happiness
on other people!

02:26.450 --> 02:28.830
There's nothing between Kaji and me.

02:29.920 --> 02:33.340
Hey, Katsuragi, I've found a bar
that serves a decent drink.

02:33.340 --> 02:35.130
How about tonight? Bye!

02:36.920 --> 02:41.180
Sure, I've never been involved in
an indecent adult relationship!

02:41.180 --> 02:44.220
And here you're acting like a proper guardian?!
You hypocrite!

02:44.220 --> 02:45.810
You make me puke!

02:46.390 --> 02:50.350
EPISODE 16: SICKNESS UNTO, DEATH, AND...

02:50.850 --> 02:53.360
B-type harmonics test, no problems.

02:53.360 --> 02:55.980
Projected adjustment values have been cleared.

02:55.980 --> 02:58.490
You look tired, Miss Misato.

02:58.490 --> 03:00.820
Yeah, for a lot of private reasons.

03:00.820 --> 03:01.740
Kaji?

03:01.740 --> 03:03.490
Shut up!

03:03.490 --> 03:05.950
Well, how's the Third Child doing?

03:05.950 --> 03:06.990
Take a look.

03:06.990 --> 03:07.450
Let me see.

03:09.120 --> 03:13.170
I hope that knowing this
will boost his confidence.

03:13.170 --> 03:14.790
Can you hear me, Shinji?

03:16.050 --> 03:18.800
Miss Misato, how were my test scores?

03:19.470 --> 03:21.880
Yes! You are Number One!

03:22.550 --> 03:26.930
Oh, man! He beat us so easily.

03:26.930 --> 03:31.730
To be honest, getting beat that easily
is a little frustrating, don't you think?

03:31.730 --> 03:35.310
He's amazing, wonderful,
awesome, too awesome!

03:36.070 --> 03:37.980
The great invincible Shinji!

03:37.980 --> 03:42.160
This just means we get to
take it easy now, right?

03:42.160 --> 03:47.290
But I guess we should at least
do our best not to be left behind.

03:47.990 --> 03:49.700
Goodbye.

03:58.630 --> 04:00.760
Please press this button
if you would like to get off

03:58.710 --> 04:03.220
Next stop is Seisho Kabuse.
Next stop, Seisho Kabuse.

04:03.220 --> 04:06.760
Convenient to the Bashar, used books
and video game stores...

04:09.430 --> 04:11.140
All right.

04:38.250 --> 04:39.920
ALERT

04:40.000 --> 04:42.590
Five minutes until evacuation of
the Western District is completed.

04:42.590 --> 04:45.430
Target is advancing slowly at 2.5 km/hr.

04:46.300 --> 04:47.220
You're late.

04:47.220 --> 04:48.220
I'm sorry.

04:48.220 --> 04:50.600
What's going on? What about
the radar observation center at Fuji?

04:50.600 --> 04:53.680
They didn't detect it. It just suddenly
appeared directly above us.

04:53.680 --> 04:56.310
Pattern orange. No AT Field detected.

04:56.310 --> 04:57.270
What does that mean?

04:57.270 --> 04:58.610
A new kind of Angel?

04:58.610 --> 05:01.030
The Magi are withholding judgment.

05:01.030 --> 05:04.490
Damn! Commander Ikari just had to be gone
at a time like this.

05:14.370 --> 05:15.790
Can you all hear me?

05:15.790 --> 05:18.210
I've sent you all of the target's data.

05:18.210 --> 05:20.630
That's all we know right now.

05:20.630 --> 05:23.090
Approach it carefully and observe its reactions,

05:23.090 --> 05:26.720
and, if possible, lure it into the airspace
outside of the city limits.

05:26.720 --> 05:29.930
One of you take point and the other two
are backup, got that?

05:29.930 --> 05:33.720
Ma'am?! I think Shinji ought to take point!

05:34.560 --> 05:38.560
Well, this is a job for the
high-scoring, utterly fearless,

05:38.560 --> 05:42.150
Number One synch-rate holder, right?

05:42.150 --> 05:44.570
Or don't you feel up to it, Shin?

05:45.190 --> 05:46.650
I can do it!

05:46.950 --> 05:48.820
I'll show you how it's done, Asuka.

05:48.820 --> 05:51.410
What was that?!

05:51.410 --> 05:52.990
Hey, you two...

05:52.990 --> 05:56.710
You said it, didn't you? "You are Number One!"

05:56.710 --> 05:58.500
Well, that was...

05:58.500 --> 06:00.540
Combat is a man's job!

06:00.540 --> 06:02.460
Talk about out of date!

06:02.460 --> 06:03.840
Unit 02 will back him up.

06:03.840 --> 06:06.260
Unit 00 will back him up as well.

06:06.590 --> 06:08.930
Damn kids, running with it...

06:08.930 --> 06:11.510
Shinji's gotten to be quite admirable, hasn't he?

06:11.510 --> 06:14.270
No, I'm going to have to chew him out
when he gets back.

06:14.270 --> 06:16.640
You'll make a good guardian.

06:20.020 --> 06:24.980
State of Emergency Declared:
Closed to General Traffic

06:32.990 --> 06:35.790
Ayanami, Asuka, are you in position yet?

06:36.290 --> 06:37.200
Not yet.

06:37.200 --> 06:40.120
You know there's no way
we could move that fast!

06:47.010 --> 06:48.380
Power Source

06:57.270 --> 06:57.930
Not there yet?

07:03.020 --> 07:05.110
I'll go ahead and stop it on my own.

07:07.650 --> 07:09.200
It disappeared!

07:09.200 --> 07:10.030
What?!

07:10.030 --> 07:12.820
Pattern blue! Angel confirmed!
Directly beneath Unit 01!

07:13.160 --> 07:14.870
A shadow?!

07:16.660 --> 07:19.250
What is this?! It's weird!

07:21.330 --> 07:23.580
Shinji, get out of there! Shinji?!

07:23.750 --> 07:24.590
Ikari?

07:24.590 --> 07:25.960
You idiot, what are you doing?!

07:28.630 --> 07:31.550
Miss Misato, what's going on?!

07:31.550 --> 07:34.600
Miss Misato? Asuka! Ayanami!
Where's the backup?

07:34.600 --> 07:38.020
Miss Misato?! Can you hear me?! Miss Misato!

07:35.970 --> 07:38.020
Eject the plug! Send the signal!

07:38.020 --> 07:39.850
It's not working! No response!

07:39.850 --> 07:42.140
Miss Misato! Miss Misato!

07:43.440 --> 07:45.150
Shinji!

07:45.150 --> 07:47.940
Asuka! Rei! Rescue Unit 01! Hurry!

07:47.940 --> 07:51.110
That idiot. What's the point of doing well
only on practice exams?!

07:53.860 --> 07:54.870
It disappeared again.

07:54.870 --> 07:56.080
Asuka, be careful.

07:56.080 --> 07:56.660
A shadow?

08:05.500 --> 08:06.840
No!

08:19.850 --> 08:20.980
The city!

08:20.980 --> 08:23.020
Asuka, Rei, pull back.

08:23.390 --> 08:23.810
Bu...

08:23.810 --> 08:25.060
Wait!

08:25.060 --> 08:26.650
Unit 01 and Ikari are still in there.

08:28.570 --> 08:31.190
This is an order. Retreat.

08:41.250 --> 08:43.660
This must be tough for Major Katsuragi.

08:44.330 --> 08:46.630
They reeled the umbilical cable back in,

08:46.630 --> 08:48.460
but the other end was missing.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.170
Then...

08:50.170 --> 08:52.880
There's not much energy
in the internal batteries.

08:52.880 --> 08:55.010
But if Shinji doesn't just
flail around with the Eva,

08:55.010 --> 08:57.180
and can hang in there in life support mode,

08:57.180 --> 08:59.100
then he can survive for sixteen hours.

09:02.100 --> 09:03.930
Second Tank Platoon deployed.

09:03.930 --> 09:05.730
Roger. Hold your current positions and stand by.

09:05.730 --> 09:08.190
Sub laser circuit has been opened.
Transmitting data now.

09:08.190 --> 09:10.570
Confirmed. New line transmitting data.

09:10.570 --> 09:13.110
The UN forces have completely surrounded it.

09:13.400 --> 09:14.450
What about the shadow?

09:14.450 --> 09:15.820
It hasn't moved.

09:15.820 --> 09:19.330
It stopped spreading once it reached
a diameter of just over 600 meters.

09:19.330 --> 09:22.370
But are the ground troops going to be any use?

09:22.370 --> 09:25.540
They think they're applying pressure on us.

09:25.540 --> 09:27.120
Good grief!

09:27.120 --> 09:29.210
Taking matters into his own hands,
ignoring the plan.

09:29.210 --> 09:31.800
Honestly, talk about getting what he deserved.

09:31.800 --> 09:34.670
Just because he got a little better score
on yesterday's tests,

09:34.670 --> 09:36.630
he was going to show me how it's done?!

09:37.300 --> 09:39.180
What a big-headed idiot!

09:40.640 --> 09:44.680
What? Is my bad-mouthing of Shinji
that much of a problem for you?!

09:46.230 --> 09:50.060
Do you pilot Eva just for the praise of others?

09:50.060 --> 09:54.110
No! Not of others! I do it because
I want to be able to praise myself!

09:54.110 --> 09:55.400
Cut it out, you two!

09:56.240 --> 09:59.370
That's right, he went out on his own.

10:00.120 --> 10:03.410
So I'll just have to scold him
when he comes back.

10:23.010 --> 10:26.850
I never thought sleeping
could be this exhausting.

10:32.440 --> 10:34.730
Still blank.

10:34.730 --> 10:39.030
No radar or sonar reflections at all.
This space must be too big.

10:40.780 --> 10:43.450
It's been twelve hours since
I switched to life-support mode.

10:46.370 --> 10:49.250
So my life will end in another four or five hours.

10:50.540 --> 10:52.130
I'm hungry.

10:52.130 --> 10:55.050
So, that shadow is actually the Angel's body?

10:55.050 --> 10:57.970
Correct. It's six hundred eighty
meters in diameter

10:57.970 --> 10:59.970
with a thickness of three nanometers.

11:00.760 --> 11:04.760
The ultra-thin space is supported by
an inwardly-directed AT Field.

11:04.760 --> 11:07.770
The inside is an imaginary space,
called a Sea of Dirac.

11:07.770 --> 11:10.600
I think it's probably connected
to another universe.

11:10.600 --> 11:12.230
What about the sphere?

11:12.230 --> 11:14.940
It disappears when the imaginary circuit
of the body closes.

11:15.230 --> 11:18.030
The object in the sky is the real shadow.

11:18.400 --> 11:22.070
So the black shadow that swallowed
Unit 01 is the target.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.910
Then there's no way that we can fight it.

11:31.750 --> 11:33.630
The water is getting cloudy!

11:33.630 --> 11:35.710
The purification system is giving out.

11:36.920 --> 11:38.550
It stinks in here!

11:38.550 --> 11:40.630
Blood! It smells of blood!

11:40.630 --> 11:42.680
No! I don't want to be here!

11:42.680 --> 11:44.970
Why can't I open the lock?

11:44.970 --> 11:47.470
Open up! Let me out!

11:47.470 --> 11:49.180
Miss Misato, what's going on?!

11:49.180 --> 11:52.140
Miss Misato! Asuka! Ayanami!

11:52.520 --> 11:54.230
Miss Ritsuko!

11:54.560 --> 11:56.400
Father...

11:59.690 --> 12:02.490
Please, someone help me.

12:02.490 --> 12:04.410
A forced Eva salvage?

12:04.410 --> 12:06.870
It's the only possibility that might work.

12:07.790 --> 12:12.870
We would drop all 992 existing
N2 mines into its center,

12:12.870 --> 12:16.670
while simultaneously activating the
AT Fields of the remaining Evas,

12:16.670 --> 12:20.050
disrupting the Angel's imaginary circuit
for one millisecond.

12:20.050 --> 12:23.260
In that instant, we'll concentrate
all the explosive energy,

12:23.260 --> 12:26.050
and destroy the Angel along
with the Sea of Dirac that forms it.

12:26.050 --> 12:29.850
But with that, the body of the Eva...
There's no telling what would happen to Shinji.

12:29.850 --> 12:31.560
That can't be called a rescue operation!

12:31.560 --> 12:35.020
This operation's top priority is
to recover Unit 01 itself.

12:35.020 --> 12:37.400
Heavy damage to the body is irrelevant.

12:37.400 --> 12:38.730
Now wait a second!

12:38.730 --> 12:40.900
In this case, the pilot's life is not our concern.

12:47.370 --> 12:51.580
If Shinji's lost, it's your fault. Don't forget that!

12:52.580 --> 12:56.790
Why are you and Commander Ikari
so worried about Unit 01?

12:58.170 --> 13:00.050
What in the hell is an Eva?

13:00.050 --> 13:02.260
I've given you all the information.

13:02.260 --> 13:02.760
You're lying!

13:06.220 --> 13:08.800
Misato, trust me.

13:11.890 --> 13:15.690
I'm taking command of this entire operation.

13:19.520 --> 13:21.440
We'll be sending some flights to
Kansai International Airport as well.

13:21.440 --> 13:24.030
Contact Air Traffic Control and the
JADF's Air Transport divisions.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.280
Roger.

13:25.280 --> 13:29.660
The Second Impact, the
Instrumentality Project, Adam...

13:29.660 --> 13:31.740
There are still secrets that I'm in the dark about.

13:38.630 --> 13:39.040
Who's there?

13:44.720 --> 13:45.090
Who's there?

13:47.470 --> 13:49.220
Shinji Ikari.

13:49.220 --> 13:50.970
That's me.

13:50.970 --> 13:55.520
I am you. People have another
self within themselves.

13:55.680 --> 13:58.520
The self is always composed of two people.

13:58.730 --> 13:59.940
Two people?

13:59.940 --> 14:03.650
The self which is actually seen,
and the self observing that.

14:03.650 --> 14:06.650
There are many entities called Shinji Ikari.

14:06.650 --> 14:10.070
The other Shinji Ikari that exists in your mind.

14:10.070 --> 14:12.990
The Shinji Ikari in Misato Katsuragi's mind,

14:12.990 --> 14:14.790
the Shinji in Asuka Sohryu,

14:14.790 --> 14:16.290
the Shinji in Rei Ayanami,

14:16.290 --> 14:18.250
and the Shinji in Gendo Ikari.

14:18.250 --> 14:20.500
All are different Shinji Ikaris,

14:20.500 --> 14:22.800
but each of them is a true Shinji Ikari.

14:22.800 --> 14:26.300
You are afraid of those Shinji Ikaris
in other people's minds.

14:26.300 --> 14:28.590
I'm afraid of other people hating me.

14:28.590 --> 14:30.760
You're afraid of being hurt.

14:32.140 --> 14:33.850
Who is at fault?

14:33.850 --> 14:35.600
Father is the one who is at fault.

14:35.600 --> 14:37.560
The father who deserted me.

14:37.560 --> 14:38.810
It's my fault.

14:38.810 --> 14:41.690
There you go, always immediately thinking
that it's your fault!

14:41.690 --> 14:43.820
That's why I say you're self-deprecating!

14:43.820 --> 14:46.150
I can't do anything.

14:46.150 --> 14:48.450
You just believe that you can't do anything.

14:49.610 --> 14:52.030
Don't you have faith in your father?

14:52.240 --> 14:55.540
I think I hate him, but now I'm not sure.

14:55.540 --> 14:57.870
Good work, Shinji.

14:57.870 --> 15:02.540
My father called me by my name.
I was praised by my father!

15:03.090 --> 15:07.010
You're going to spend the rest of your life
ruminating on that happiness?

15:07.010 --> 15:10.380
If I believe in those words, I can keep on living.

15:10.380 --> 15:12.140
As you continue to deceive yourself?

15:12.140 --> 15:15.220
Everybody does it!
That's how everyone survives.

15:15.220 --> 15:17.890
Believe that you're fine with the way things are,

15:17.890 --> 15:19.980
or you won't be able to keep living.

15:19.980 --> 15:24.110
There's too much hardship in this world
for me to keep living.

15:24.110 --> 15:25.570
For example, the fact you can't swim?

15:25.570 --> 15:27.690
Humans aren't made to float!

15:27.690 --> 15:28.780
That is self-deception.

15:28.780 --> 15:30.400
I don't care what you call it!

15:31.660 --> 15:35.330
You've shut your eyes and turned a deaf ear
to the things you don't like.

15:35.410 --> 15:37.740
His sister was injured during the incident.

15:37.740 --> 15:39.710
Who cares what the others say?!

15:40.460 --> 15:41.370
Leave!

15:41.370 --> 15:42.670
No, I don't want to hear this!

15:44.330 --> 15:45.920
See? You're running away again.

15:47.840 --> 15:52.590
There's no way you can live by linking
just the enjoyable moments like a rosary.

15:52.590 --> 15:54.640
Especially not me.

15:54.640 --> 15:56.680
I've found something I enjoy!

15:56.680 --> 15:59.680
Finding something you enjoy
and doing nothing but that...

15:59.680 --> 16:01.690
What's wrong with that?!

16:04.650 --> 16:06.570
In theory, the entry plug's energy reserves

16:06.570 --> 16:08.530
should be reaching their expiration point.

16:08.530 --> 16:11.860
The plug suit's life support system
will be getting close to redline.

16:12.450 --> 16:14.620
Advance the schedule by twelve minutes.

16:14.620 --> 16:17.580
Let's do it while there's a chance
that Shinji's still alive.

16:32.510 --> 16:35.720
Father, am I unwanted?

16:37.260 --> 16:39.060
Father!

16:39.060 --> 16:41.350
You're the one who ran away.

16:41.930 --> 16:45.190
That's right! He may be guilty
of killing his own wife!

16:42.810 --> 16:42.890
EXPEDITION
TEAM
RETURNS

16:43.100 --> 16:43.180
SECOND IMPACT'S...

16:43.230 --> 16:43.480
"CRYSTALLIZED DNA" THEORY
PRIDE OF OUR NATION'S DNA FIELD

16:43.730 --> 16:43.810
DARK SIDE OF THE U.N.
UNDISCLOSED ORGANIZATION'S CORRUPT...

16:43.850 --> 16:43.940
U.N. UNDISCLOSED...

16:43.980 --> 16:44.140
THE LIGHT AND SHADOW OF THE
TOKYO UNIVERSITY ACADEMIC CLIQUE

16:44.520 --> 16:44.600
ENTERPRISE AND ADHESION

16:44.940 --> 16:45.060
YEAR 2004

16:45.100 --> 16:45.190
DNA
MANIPULATION

16:45.190 --> 16:46.940
He killed his own wife!

16:45.230 --> 16:45.310
AT THE ARTIFICIAL
EVOLUTION LABORATORY CRITICAL ACCIDENT?

16:45.350 --> 16:45.440
FEAR OF BIOHAZARD
ENGINEERS EATING AWAY
AT GOD'S DOMAIN

16:45.650 --> 16:45.730
FEAR

16:45.810 --> 16:45.900
ONE
DEAD

16:45.940 --> 16:46.100
...TO CONDUCT RESEARCH FOR...
...RESEARCHING IN THE SAME LAB...
...MS. YUI IKARI (27)...
...FELL VICTIM TO IT.
...MISTAKE IN CONTROL.

16:46.190 --> 16:46.270
...MISTAKE!

16:46.310 --> 16:46.400
QUESTIONS OF HUMAN EXPERIMENTATION

16:46.690 --> 16:46.770
MAN-MADE CALAMITY

16:46.810 --> 16:46.900
BIOINFORMATION...

16:46.940 --> 16:48.980
No! Mother was...

16:47.060 --> 16:47.150
OUT OF CONTROL

16:47.190 --> 16:47.270
ESTABLISHED RISK
FORMER RESEARCH COLLEAGUES CRITICIZED

16:47.310 --> 16:47.380
BRIBERY

16:47.400 --> 16:47.520
DIRECTOR GENDO IKARI

16:47.610 --> 16:47.650
GENOME BIOLOGY

16:47.690 --> 16:47.770
SUPREME COURT RULES NOT GUILTY

16:47.810 --> 16:47.900
THE DEFICIENCY OF BIOETHICS

16:48.110 --> 16:48.190
GOD'S
ART

16:48.980 --> 16:50.860
Smiling...

16:50.860 --> 16:53.700
You did a very praiseworthy thing today.

16:54.490 --> 16:56.700
Shinji, you must not run away.

16:57.370 --> 16:59.160
Do your best.

17:00.620 --> 17:01.750
I hate this place.

17:03.250 --> 17:04.370
I don't want to be alone...

17:06.880 --> 17:07.670
...anymore.

17:11.260 --> 17:13.970
The heating and the oxygen circulation
are already out.

17:17.640 --> 17:18.970
I'm cold.

17:20.560 --> 17:24.230
It's useless, the suit is giving out too.

17:25.940 --> 17:27.730
So this is the end.

17:28.650 --> 17:30.480
I'm tired...

17:31.860 --> 17:33.570
Of it all.

18:06.770 --> 18:08.060
Mother?

18:16.070 --> 18:17.900
Are you ready?

18:19.820 --> 18:22.780
Well, that's good for you.

18:25.870 --> 18:27.790
Both Evas are in position.

18:27.790 --> 18:29.960
AT field generation ready.

18:29.960 --> 18:30.830
Roger.

18:30.830 --> 18:32.920
Sixty seconds to mine drop.

18:37.970 --> 18:39.220
What's happening?!

18:44.180 --> 18:45.180
Status report!

18:45.180 --> 18:46.220
Unknown!

18:46.220 --> 18:49.060
All meters and gauges are going off the scale.

18:49.060 --> 18:50.770
But we haven't done anything yet.

18:50.770 --> 18:52.020
No way, Shinji?!

18:52.020 --> 18:53.230
It's impossible!

18:53.230 --> 18:54.940
Unit 01's power level is zero!

19:25.850 --> 19:28.810
I'm piloting something like that?

19:31.140 --> 19:35.440
What kind... what kind of monster
have we copied from?

19:35.940 --> 19:39.110
I know that the Evas aren't just
copies of the First Angel.

19:39.950 --> 19:44.660
But what is Nerv going to do with them
once all the Angels have been destroyed?

20:19.990 --> 20:24.240
Shinji?! Shinji?! Shinji?!

20:25.410 --> 20:27.530
Shinji?! Are you all right, Shinji?!

20:35.920 --> 20:39.380
I just wanted to see you one more time.

20:42.300 --> 20:44.220
Weren't you going to scold him?

20:48.310 --> 20:52.310
I have never thought these Evas
were as frightening as I did today.

20:53.020 --> 20:55.230
Are the Evas really on our side?

20:55.850 --> 20:59.110
They may hate us.

21:00.280 --> 21:03.950
I think that Major Katsuragi
may have noticed something.

21:03.950 --> 21:06.570
I see. Let her be for now.

21:06.570 --> 21:09.370
If Rei or Shinji were to find out the Eva's secrets,

21:09.370 --> 21:11.290
they'd never forgive us, would they?

21:24.340 --> 21:27.840
Stay in bed for today.
We'll take care of the rest.

21:29.430 --> 21:31.600
But I'm fine now.

21:31.600 --> 21:33.140
Well, that's good for you.

21:56.460 --> 21:58.540
The smell of blood won't come off.

21:58.580 --> 22:00.630
TO BE CONTINUED

22:04.880 --> 22:06.340
<i><i>Do you love me?</i></i>

22:06.340 --> 22:07.970
<i><i>Hey, you wanna kiss?</i></i>

22:07.970 --> 22:09.470
<i><i>Why don't you become one with me?</i></i>

22:09.470 --> 22:10.430
<i><i>Who are you?</i></i>

22:10.430 --> 22:11.600
<i><i>Loneliness?</i></i>

22:11.100 --> 22:14.180
<i>If you become one both in mind and body,</i>

22:11.600 --> 22:12.850
<i><i>Who are you?</i></i>

22:12.850 --> 22:16.730
<i><i>Pleasure... Sky of reality... Cruel strangers...</i></i>

22:14.180 --> 22:17.310
<i>it's a very, very comforting feeling.</i>

22:17.890 --> 22:20.480
<i>Do you want me?</i>

22:20.480 --> 22:22.650
<i>Do you love me?</i>

22:22.650 --> 22:24.900
<i>Do you love me?</i>

23:06.150 --> 23:07.570
PREVIEW

23:07.440 --> 23:10.320
Eva Unit 04, which was being built in America,

23:10.320 --> 23:12.870
vanished along with Nerv's 2nd Branch.

23:12.870 --> 23:16.450
This incident forces them
to select a new Eva pilot.

23:16.450 --> 23:18.080
Next episode: "The Fourth Qualified Individual"

23:17.910 --> 23:21.170
THE FOURTH QUALIFIED INDIVIDUAL
